        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cherryhillsvillage.com/315/History-of-Cherry-Hills-Village",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A steering committee divided the new town into six districts, electing a trustee from each district by the entire electorate.",
